\label{sec:monotonicity-methods}

Let $U\subset\R^n$ be bounded with smooth boundary, let $f\in L^2(U)$, and consider
\[
\begin{cases}
-\Div\,\mathbf a(Du)=f & \text{in }U,\\
u=0 & \text{on }\partial U,
\end{cases}
\tag{1}
\]
where $\mathbf a:\R^n\to\R^n$ is smooth.

